{"_id":"64942abbfbeeb2a5","name":"Blood Mage","type":"discipline","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"definitionId":"veilrunner.discipline.magus.blood-mage","intents":["chargen-selectable"],"providedActionIds":[],"professionId":"veilrunner.profession.magus","profession":"Magus","summary":"Blood Mages utilize their own blood to amplify their magic and spells. Their spells cast are primarily offensive magic.","quote":"","primaryWeapon":"Blood Magic","primaryAttributes":["Intelligence","Wisdom"],"bonusAttributes":["Focus","Intelligence"],"bonusSkill":"Blood Bolt","persona":["+10 Criminal"],"tags":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Tainted Blood","type":"Trait","text":"Your blood has been tainted with aether after countless spells casted with blood magic. Spells casted with blood magic are more potent. Spells casted with the blood magic deal additional +1d4 unsuspected damage at level 5 and every 5 levels thereafter."}],"pageImage":"","source":"","sourcePage":"","description":"Blood Mages are despised and hunted down for execution by the Galactic Federation and The Grand Church of Elatashi. After destroying their phylactery Blood Mages have historically brought rampant destruction across sectors of the galaxy.\n\nThis subset of magic was forbidden after atrocities entered real-space and brought ruin to the galaxy. After the fall of the Galactic Empire, legends say that the remaining survivors slaughtered the intruders and sent them back from whence they came. The vaults that held the forbidden art was lost in the centuries of rampant destruction and violence.\n\nIn 29 GE the lost vaults were uncovered on Oiruta. The return of Blood Magic brought once again brought beings from the dimension of hell to ravage real-space. The Planet Oiruta was quickly overwhelmed as demons, infernal beasts, and other hellspawn wreaked havoc across the planet. May mercy be upon us."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":3300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"veilrunner":{"profession":"Magus","discipline":"Blood Mage","abilities":[{"name":"Tainted Blood","type":"Trait","text":"Your blood has been tainted with aether after countless spells casted with blood magic. Spells casted with blood magic are more potent. Spells casted with the blood magic deal additional +1d4 unsuspected damage at level 5 and every 5 levels thereafter."}]}},"_stats":{"systemId":"Veilrunner","systemVersion":"0.0.16","coreVersion":"14.365","createdTime":1787443200000,"modifiedTime":1787443200000,"lastModifiedBy":null}}
{"_id":"6e551ffdf0329237","name":"Scout","type":"discipline","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"definitionId":"veilrunner.discipline.infiltrator.scout","intents":["chargen-selectable"],"providedActionIds":[],"professionId":"veilrunner.profession.infiltrator","profession":"Infiltrator","summary":"","quote":"","primaryWeapon":"","primaryAttributes":[],"bonusAttributes":[],"bonusSkill":"","persona":[],"tags":[],"abilities":[],"pageImage":"","source":"","sourcePage":"","description":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":6400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"veilrunner":{"profession":"Infiltrator","discipline":"Scout","abilities":[]}},"_stats":{"systemId":"Veilrunner","systemVersion":"0.0.16","coreVersion":"14.365","createdTime":1787443200000,"modifiedTime":1787443200000,"lastModifiedBy":null}}
{"_id":"752981824a5a40d8","name":"Shield Guardian","type":"discipline","img":"systems/veilrunner/assets/img/professions/vanguard.png","system":{"definitionId":"veilrunner.discipline.vanguard.shield-guardian","intents":["chargen-selectable"],"providedActionIds":[],"professionId":"veilrunner.profession.vanguard","profession":"Vanguard","summary":"An immovable defender who holds position against assaults and protects nearby allies.","quote":"","primaryWeapon":"Heavy Shield","primaryAttributes":["Strength","Reaction"],"bonusAttributes":["Dexterity","Reaction"],"bonusSkill":"Shield Bash","persona":["+5 Ruthless","+5 Collectivist"],"tags":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Extended Shifting Block","type":"Trait","text":"With a shield equipped, shift into place when an ally is attacked. Your shifting block range increases by reach + 4m and you may shift the ally up to your reach."},{"name":"Steel Resolve","type":"Ability","text":"With a shield equipped, resist half damage rounded down for the next round. Twice per Field Recovery."}],"pageImage":"systems/veilrunner/assets/img/professions/vanguard.png","source":"Veilrunner 2026.07.30.pdf","sourcePage":"6","description":"Shield Guardians are referred to as the immovable defender. Once entrenched into a position they will hold at any cost. Once a Division of Shield Guardians has entrenched a position the opposition has limited amount of time before they encroach upon their position bringing judgment to those that oppose them. Shield Guardians proudly wear scars from where they held the line against all odds. Unable to return to civilian life, Shield Guardians find themselves looking for a thrill."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"veilrunner":{"source":"Veilrunner 2026.07.30.pdf","professionSummary":"Vanguards protect allies by drawing attacks and fire. They rely on physical shields, heavy armor, and energy shields.","disciplineSummary":"An immovable defender who holds position against assaults and protects nearby allies.","abilities":[{"name":"Extended Shifting Block","type":"Trait","text":"With a shield equipped, shift into place when an ally is attacked. Your shifting block range increases by reach + 4m and you may shift the ally up to your reach."},{"name":"Steel Resolve","type":"Ability","text":"With a shield equipped, resist half damage rounded down for the next round. Twice per Field Recovery."}],"profession":"Vanguard","discipline":"Shield Guardian"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"Veilrunner","systemVersion":"0.0.16","coreVersion":"14.365","createdTime":1787443200000,"modifiedTime":1787443200000,"lastModifiedBy":null}}
